Merchant: Mayap a gatpanapun! You and Litik look new to town.
You: We're looking for the second Mystic Ylang-Ylang. Do you know where it grows?
Merchant: Not exactly. But people have been talking about strange changes around the old well.
Merchant: I promised to deliver supplies to three neighbors, but I can't leave my stall.
You: We can help with the deliveries.
Merchant: Dakal a salamat! First, I'll show you how to count the baskets in Kapampangan.
Merchant: Watch carefully. We'll learn the numbers one at a time, then you can decide when you're ready to deliver.
[signal arg="st_merchant_delivery_lesson"]
[end_timeline]
